# ============================================================
# Ignore ALL dot files and dot directories (at every level)
# ============================================================
.*

# Keep this .gitignore itself tracked, so the rules ship with the repo
!.gitignore

# NOTE: `.*` also hides `.github/` (CI workflows) and `.README.md`.
# To track any of them again, uncomment the lines below.
# (Files inside an ignored directory can only be re-included
#  if the directory itself is re-included first.)
#!.github
#!.github/**
#!.README.md
